            "value": "This archive contains the data and Jupyter notebook used to generate figures for the article:  \"Exotic  quantum  critical  point  in  a  two-site  charge  Kondo  circuit\" by Winston Pouse, Lucas Peeters, Connie L. Hsueh, Ulf Gennser, Antonella Cavanna, Marc A. Kastner, Andrew K. Mitchell, and David Goldhaber-Gordon. See readme for further details.  https://arxiv.org/abs/2108.12878\r\n",
